<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/common-head') %>
    <title><%= title %></title>
</head>
<body>
<%- include('partials/header') %>
<main>
    <section class="text-section" id="why-section">
        <h1>Why type fast?</h1>
        <p class="text-section__paragraph">
            Keyboards existed for much longer than you think they did. As well as typing
            bla-bla-bla-bla-bla-bla-bla. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipisicing elit.
            Hic numquam voluptatem officiis adipisci repellendus fuga praesentium maiores voluptas
            ad id, laboriosam inventore harum iste quisquam tempore, cum ducimus? Corrupti, non?
        </p>
        <div class="text-section__grid grid">
            <div class="grid__card card">
                <img class="card__image" src="/assets/typewriter.jpg" alt="Old keyboard"/>
                <p class="card__text">Old Keyboard</p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid__card card">
                <img class="card__image" src="/assets/mechanical-keyboard.webp" alt="Modern keyboard"/>
                <p class="card__text">Modern Keyboard</p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid__card card">
                <img class="card__image" src="/assets/an-image.jpg" alt="Generic"/>
                <p class="card__text">An image with description</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <ul class="text-section__list list">
            <li class="list__item">You can brag about it online!</li>
            <li class="list__item">You can finish essays quicker!</li>
            <li class="list__item">You can make better notes from lectures!</li>
            <li class="list__item">You can perform better in programming competitions!</li>
        </ul>
    </section>
    <div class="separator"></div>
    <section class="text-section">
        <h1>How do I type faster?</h1>
        <ol class="text-section__list list">
            <li class="list__item">Use <i>all 10</i> of your fingers.</li>
            <li class="list__item">
                Keep your fingers at the <i>home row of the keyboard</i> in between pressing keys.
            </li>
            <li class="list__item">Use your <i>pinkies</i>!</li>
            <li class="list__item"><i>Remember </i> the location of every key on the keyboard.</li>
            <li class="list__item"><i>Speed up</i> your pace!</li>
        </ol>
    </section>
    <div class="separator"></div>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
